%% Modules exist; they are separate screens/APIs, not one automated state machine.

flowchart TB
  PREC[PRECAUTION]
  PREC --> W[Weather intelligence<br/>WeatherPage + /weather/*]
  W --> R[Risk prediction<br/>RiskIntelligencePage + /risk/*]
  R --> E[Early warning<br/>AlertsPage + AlertEngine]

  RESP[RESPONSE]
  E --> RESP
  RESP --> SAT[Satellite analysis]
  RESP --> CV[Computer vision]
  RESP --> FD[Flood detection]
  RESP --> SIT[Situation / dashboard GIS]
  RESP --> RP[Rescue planning]

  REC[RECOVERY]
  RP --> REC
  REC --> DM[Damage assessment]
  REC --> INF[Infrastructure / roads / buildings<br/>in seed + incident picture]
  REC --> AN[Analytics + reports JSON/CSV]

  SAT --> FD
  FD --> SIT
